From Twitter;

Danielle Bedics ‏@daniellebedics  Apr 18
Hold that pose! #squirrel @DescansoGardens #nature #exploredescanso #MydayinLA #dayoff #NatureinLA #animals #tree

conditions: 27 degrees- early morning.
Fox Squirrels (in this area) seem to never stop going; the deep cold and snow and winter is not a challenge;
no wonder they have taken over this part of the east bench area - and use utility lines to travel - between the trees...
